sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin / Event Trigger
    participant Server as Express Server (server.js)
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas (notifications & users)
    participant Sockets as Socket.IO Hub
    participant GAS as Google Apps Script Email Relay
    participant FCM as Firebase Cloud Messaging (Web Push)
    actor Student as Student Operative (Client Browser)

    Note over Admin, Student: 1. EVENT OCCURRENCE & PERSISTENCE
    Admin->>Server: Trigger Event (e.g. Squad Join, Hackathon Announce, Certificate Issued)
    Server->>DB: Query recipient operative record(s)
    Server->>DB: Insert in-app Notification record { userId, title, message, category, link, read: false }
    
    Note over Server, Student: 2. REALTIME IN-APP DELIVERY (WebSockets & Store)
    Server->>Sockets: Emit 'notification:new' to room `user:<userId>`
    Sockets-->>Student: Deliver realtime payload to active session
    Student->>Student: Increment Bell Badge & toast notification

    Note over Server, GAS: 3. EXTERNAL EMAIL RELAY (Zero-Budget HTTP Relay)
    opt User notification preferences include Email
        Server->>Server: Build responsive HTML email template
        Server->>GAS: POST https://script.google.com/macros/s/.../exec { to, subject, html, secret }
        alt Relay Success
            GAS-->>Server: 200 OK { status: 'sent', id: 'msg-...' }
        else Free Tier SMTP Failure / Offline
            Server->>Server: Log fallback to in-app notification without crashing request
        end
    end

    Note over Server, FCM: 4. BROWSER PUSH NOTIFICATIONS (Optional FCM Web Push)
    opt FCM device token registered on client
        Server->>FCM: admin.messaging().send({ token, notification: { title, body } })
        FCM-->>Student: ServiceWorker push event -> Show OS Notification
    end
